NoteId
├── given a freshly constructed NoteId
│   ├── when all fields are set via add* builders
│   │   ├── it roundtrips poolIndex through getter.
│   │   ├── it roundtrips vegoid through getter.
│   │   ├── it roundtrips epochLength through getter.
│   │   ├── it roundtrips extensionFlag through getter.
│   │   ├── it roundtrips notionalRatio through getter.
│   │   ├── it roundtrips isLong through getter.
│   │   ├── it roundtrips tokenType through getter.
│   │   ├── it roundtrips tickLower through getter.
│   │   ├── it roundtrips tickUpper through getter.
│   │   └── it roundtrips epochId through getter.
│   └── when fields are set independently
│       └── it does not corrupt adjacent fields.
├── given tickLower >= tickUpper
│   └── it reverts on validate with InvalidRange.
├── given notionalRatio is zero
│   └── it reverts on validate with InvalidNotionalRatio.
└── given valid parameters
    └── it passes validate without reverting.
